--- !u!114 &571772242
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 571772238}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ffa75b543bbe49d689ace469e577f421, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OutsideTempleDialogue
  flow: {fileID: 571772239}
  dialogueText: {fileID: 331762862}
  catPortrait: {fileID: 1629045966}
  speakerText: {fileID: 508346954}
  pageCounterText: {fileID: 0}
  nextButtonText: {fileID: 1071953273}
  backButton: {fileID: 1638511247}
  skipButton: {fileID: 1479700175}
  speakerName: Lucky Cat
  charactersPerSecond: 45
  pages:
  - text: There you are! This temple needs a little attention. <b>Clean its puzzles,
      deal with the spirits, and face the dragon</b> waiting within.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Use <b>WASD or the arrow keys</b> to move. Step on floor plates in order,
      and press <b>E</b> near talismans and lanterns. Clean before time runs out
      - and light those lanterns quickly!
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - text: When the spirits appear, <b>left-click</b> to attack. <b>E</b> stuns ordinary
      enemies, but your own stun won't let you seal them. Lure them into a <b>waterfall</b>,
      then get close, face them, and press <b>E</b> to seal instead.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The dragon won't fall for your ordinary stun. Bait its charge into a <b>pillar</b>
      to stun it. Defeat it with attacks, or weaken it to <b>very low health</b>,
      then press <b>E</b> up close while it's stunned to seal it.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That little cat meter? That's my <b>Happiness</b>. Solve puzzles to improve
      it; mistakes and unfinished puzzles can lower it. Higher Happiness gives your
      Lucky Reel <b>better odds</b> - not a guarantee!
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - text: <b>Sealing lowers Karma; killing raises it.</b> Low Karma favors peaceful
      good fortune, while high Karma favors offensive good fortune. Near the middle,
      either can happen. Watch the seven-slot selector!
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Press <b>Q</b> when your <b>Lucky Reel</b> is ready. It also spins on its
      own! Fortune can help or hinder you. Watch your ability bars for cooldowns,
      and press <b>Escape</b> to pause inside the temple.
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
